==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*The bonus damage (reported as [[Divine damage|magical damage]]) is from a [[damage increase]] effect, so it ignores both [[damage resistance]] and damage [[immunity]].
*The bonus to attack provided by this spell counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
*This spell applies to the character, not to the weapon, and is therefore unaffected by changing weapons.

